rbxport
-------
rbx-cli is built on the rbl-* crates of rbxport
(https://github.com/chrisle/rbxport), used as unmodified git dependencies
pinned to one revision (see `rbx-cli version`):

  Copyright (c) 2026 Chris Le
  Licensed under GPL-2.0-or-later.

Binary distributions
--------------------
Release binaries statically link third-party Rust crates and C libraries,
among them:

  - mp3lame-encoder / LAME (LGPL-3.0), used by rbxport for MP3 conversion.
    LGPL-3.0 code can be combined with GPL-3.0 but not with GPL-2.0-only
    terms, so a distributed rbx-cli binary is effectively licensed under
    GPL-3.0, using the "or any later version" option of GPL-2.0-or-later.
  - SQLCipher (BSD-3-Clause) and OpenSSL (Apache-2.0), compiled in through
    rusqlite's bundled-sqlcipher-vendored-openssl feature.
  - symphonia (MPL-2.0), rubato, realfft, lofty, image and others under
    permissive licenses (MIT and/or Apache-2.0).

The corresponding source of a release is the tagged revision of
https://github.com/tainakanchu/rbx-cli together with the exact dependency
versions in its Cargo.lock.

